  # BranchKit verify it was really built by THIS repo — installs then get
  # the verified-publisher trust posture instead of the reduced "unsigned"
  # one. This uses your workflow's own GitHub OIDC identity (attest-build-
  # provenance), so the attestation's certificate names this repository —
  # the model BranchKit's install path checks against your plugin's
  # `publisher` field. No keys to manage.
  #
  # Uncomment, and set your plugin's `publisher` to "github:{{.PluginID}}-owner"
  # (your GitHub org/user). Runs on tag pushes alongside your release.
